      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.06,
      "end_seconds": 144.33,
      "duration_seconds": 21.27,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. My partner and our baby. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
