      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.75,
      "end_seconds": 193.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "mm-hmm. Alright can you list what you take tablets creams or inhalers? I'll explain everything as we go along"
