      "start_seconds": 240.65,
      "end_seconds": 250.94,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 69 beats a minute temp 36.8 degrees oxygen saturation is 97 percent. And pressure 114 over 77."
